{"originalLanguage":"ja","title":"태엽소녀시계","artist":"Drop & 葉月ゆら feat. 初音ミク","date":"2026-10-11","sourceId":"15631910:014","sourceHash":"7c4fb0f65b27c0ff9c63ee2f9f98903201e2ceb567b4c8cce1c80dd6c82df238","duration":285.3,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":12.35668699999951,"end":18.35668699999951,"text":"tic-tac-tic 遊んで刻むの","translation":"틱택틱 놀며 새겨 가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":18.55968700000085,"end":24.55968700000085,"text":"le montre de la vie(命の懐中時計)","translation":"생명의 회중시계","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":24.76268699999855,"end":27.722687000001315,"text":"子供のままで et toi?(貴方)","translation":"아이인 채로 넌 어때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":27.782686999998987,"end":33.78268699999899,"text":"私と踊りましょう","translation":"나와 춤추자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":40.25268700000015,"end":46.25268700000015,"text":"夢幻の世界は御伽の terrarium(星体飼育箱)","translation":"꿈결 같은 세계는 동화 속 테라리움","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":52.722687000001315,"end":58.722687000001315,"text":"道化に溺れた棘の marionnettes(あやつり人形)","translation":"광대에 빠진 가시의 마리오네트","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":65.19268699999884,"end":71.19268699999884,"text":"お喋りポットに 隠してる 時の種","translation":"재잘대는 주전자에 감춰 둔 시간의 씨앗","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":71.55268699999942,"end":77.55268699999942,"text":"悪い子でもいい 『まだ眠りたいの』","translation":"나쁜 아이라도 좋아 아직 잠들고 싶어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":78.31768699999884,"end":84.31768699999884,"text":"謎々をあげる すべて解けなくちゃ","translation":"수수께끼를 줄게 모두 풀어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":85.08268699999826,"end":90.46268699999928,"text":"泣き兎と嗤い熊たち","translation":"우는 토끼와 비웃는 곰들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":90.52268700000059,"end":95.90268699999797,"text":"御褒美に手品処刑","translation":"상으로 마술 처형을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":95.96268699999928,"end":101.3426870000003,"text":"shala lu-lala 謡って","translation":"샤라 루랄라 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":101.40268699999797,"end":107.40268699999797,"text":"お菓子が囁くように","translation":"과자가 속삭이듯","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":108.9686870000005,"end":114.9686870000005,"text":"le fleur de coquelicot(雛芥子の香り)","translation":"양귀비꽃 향기","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":116.5346869999994,"end":122.5346869999994,"text":"囚える collier des sombre(闇の首輪)","translation":"가두는 어둠의 목걸이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":124.10068699999829,"end":130.1006869999983,"text":"不変の闇夜は蜜月 vivarium(生体飼育箱)","translation":"변함없는 어둔 밤은 밀월의 비바리움","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":131.66668700000082,"end":137.66668700000082,"text":"禁忌を侵した咎人 espoir(希望)","translation":"금기를 범한 죄인 그 희망","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":139.23268699999971,"end":145.23268699999971,"text":"鏡の向こうで 赤い羊 舞踏会","translation":"거울 너머 붉은 양들의 무도회","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":147.15268699999797,"end":153.15268699999797,"text":"髑髏が会釈をして 『お手をどうぞ』","translation":"해골이 고개 숙여 손을 내밀어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":154.7976869999984,"end":160.7976869999984,"text":"踊る輪の中で 影と隠れんぼ","translation":"춤추는 원 안에서 그림자와 숨바꼭질","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":162.44268699999884,"end":166.42968699999983,"text":"堕ちる天使 焦がれゆく夢魔","translation":"추락하는 천사 애타는 몽마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":166.48968700000114,"end":170.4776869999987,"text":"罪纏う grand guignol(見世物小屋)","translation":"죄를 두른 그랑 기뇰","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":170.537687,"end":174.5256870000012,"text":"kirara ri-la 奪って","translation":"키라라 리라 빼앗아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":174.58568699999887,"end":178.57268699999986,"text":"秘め事 ついばむように","translation":"비밀을 쪼아 먹듯","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":178.63268700000117,"end":182.6006869999983,"text":"瞳の中に etoiles(明星)","translation":"눈동자 속 별들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":182.6606869999996,"end":186.62768700000015,"text":"夢見る les ombres chinoises(影絵)","translation":"꿈꾸는 그림자극","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":186.68768700000146,"end":190.65568699999858,"text":"黒金の鎖 白銀の禁絲","translation":"흑금의 사슬 백은의 금실","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":190.7156869999999,"end":194.68268700000044,"text":"想い出が輝く un manege(回転木馬)","translation":"추억이 빛나는 회전목마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":194.7426869999981,"end":198.70968699999867,"text":"懺悔の涙に 恐怖が咲いたら","translation":"참회의 눈물에 공포가 피어나면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":198.76968699999998,"end":202.73768700000073,"text":"捕まえてあげるの","translation":"잡아 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":202.7976869999984,"end":206.76468699999896,"text":"tic-tac-tic殺して刻むの","translation":"틱택틱 죽이며 새겨 가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":206.82468700000027,"end":210.79268700000102,"text":"le montre de la vie(命の懐中時計)","translation":"생명의 회중시계","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":210.8526869999987,"end":216.8526869999987,"text":"大人になったら et toi?(貴方)","translation":"어른이 된다면 넌 어때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":217.05568700000003,"end":223.05568700000003,"text":"裏切りは I will never forgive","translation":"배신만큼은 절대 용서하지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":223.25868700000137,"end":229.25868700000137,"text":"thala tu-lala 呪って","translation":"탈라 투랄라 저주해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":229.46168699999907,"end":235.46168699999907,"text":"時計が呟くように","translation":"시계가 중얼거리듯","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":235.6646870000004,"end":241.6646870000004,"text":"le fleur de coquelicot(雛芥子の香り)","translation":"양귀비꽃 향기","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":241.8676869999981,"end":247.8676869999981,"text":"おやすみ collier des sombre(闇の首輪)","translation":"잘 자 어둠의 목걸이","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}